{"product_id":"i-am-malala","title":"I Am Malala","description":"\u003cp\u003eI come from a country which was created at midnight. When I almost died it was just after midday.\u003cbr\u003e\nWhen the Taliban took control of he Swat Valley, one girl spoke out.  Malala Yousafzai refused to be silcenced and fought for her right to an education.  \u003cbr\u003e\nOn Tuesday, 9 October 2012, she almost paid the ultimate price.  Shot in the head  at point-blank range while riding the bus home from school, she was not expected to survivie.  Instead, Malala's miraculous recovery has taken her on an extraordinary journey from a remote valley in northern Pakistan to the halls of the UN in New York. At sixteen, she has become a global symbol of peaceful protest and the youngest ever nominee for the Nobel Peace Prize.  I am Malala is the remarkable tale of a family uprooted by global terrorism, of the fight for girls' education, and of Malala's parents' fierce love for their daugther in a society that prizes sons. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:22 x 233  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Christina Lamb | Malala Yousafzai \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780297870920 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 276\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43480504336537,"sku":"17RB-2-9780297870920","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/i-am-malala-980786.jpg?v=1696962176","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/i-am-malala","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}